BaseConfigLib::hasAnyMandateCheck
├── given no mandate fields enabled
│   └── it should return false
├── given only target field enabled (RECIPIENT)
│   └── it should return true
├── given only ORIGIN_OPS enabled
│   └── it should return true
├── given only DEST_OPS enabled
│   └── it should return true
├── given only QUALIFICATION enabled
│   └── it should return true
└── given multiple mandate fields enabled
    └── it should return true